              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கிளம்பலாமா? (kiḷampalāmā?) is native Dravidian. DEDR 1583 lists Malayalam kiḷampuka, \"to rise\". The entry lists kiḷampu, \"to rise, to start up\": to leave is to get up and go."
